## {{H_CUSTOMIZE}}

```bash
cortex-neo configure --language {{LANGUAGE}} --palette blue --font ubuntu
cortex-neo configure --detail-level essential
cortex-neo configure --profile compact --density comfortable
cortex-neo configure --profile full --density complete --detail-level full
```

{{PATH_NOTE}}

- **{{F_PALETTES}}:** `blue`, `teal`, `green`, `yellow`, `orange`, `red`, `pink`, `purple`, `slate`, `brown`.
- **{{F_FONTS}}:** `ubuntu` (Ubuntu Sans Mono), `dejavu` (DejaVu Sans Mono), `liberation` (Liberation Mono). {{FONT_FALLBACK}}
- **{{F_DETAILS}}:** {{DETAIL_TEXT}}
- **{{F_LAYOUT}}:** {{LAYOUT_TEXT}}

{{GALLERY_TEXT}} [{{GALLERY_LINK}}]({{DOCS_ROOT}}/reference/appearance.md).

